s="mb-6 font-sans text-sm"><a class="text-[color:var(--fg-muted)] hover:text-[color:var(--accent-info)]" href="/">← All proposals</a></nav><header class="mb-10 border-b border-[color:var(--rule)] pb-6"><div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]"><span>Intersect</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Tooling/DevEx</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>hydra</span></div><h1 class="mb-2">Cardano MCP by Lido Nation &amp; 2 Lovelaces</h1><p class="font-sans text-sm text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">2 Lovelaces &amp; Lido Nation</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-sm text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]"><span>ID: </span><code class="font-mono text-[color:var(--fg)]">69fbc8dd85ddd26899aaf207</code></p></header><section class="mb-10"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">Cardano is the only major blockchain without a production AI developer MCP. This proposal funds the production build of cardano-mcp — a working prototype already live at github.com/lidonation/Cardano-mcp — into 54 production-grade tools across six modules: query, transaction building, tokens and NFTs, smart contracts, indexing, and a 26-tool governance and DRep workbench built specifically for CIP-1694 participation. The governance module is the proposal&#x27;s defining contribution.</p><p class="mt-3 font-sans text-sm"><a href="https://hydra-voting.intersectmbo.org/votes/cardano-budget-2026/69fbc8dd85ddd26899aaf207" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[color:var(--accent-info)] hover:underline">↗ <!-- -->View full proposal on Intersect Hydra Voting</a></p></section><section class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-5"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[--radius-md] border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] p-3 pl-4 font-sans shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]" style="border-left:4px solid var(--accent-info)"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">Ask (ADA)</div><div class="mt-1 font-medium tabular-nums">339,900</div></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[--radius-md] border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] p-3 pl-4 font-sans shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]" style="border-left:4px solid var(--status-green)"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">Ask (USD)</div><div class="mt-1 font-medium tabular-nums">$61,182</div></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[--radius-md] border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] p-3 pl-4 font-sans shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]" style="border-left:4px solid var(--status-amber)"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">Peg</div><div class="mt-1 font-medium tabular-nums">$0.18</div></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[--radius-md] border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] p-3 pl-4 font-sans shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]" style="border-left:4px solid var(--accent-primary)"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">Eff. ADA @ spot</div><div class="mt-1 font-medium tabular-nums">255,179</div></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[--radius-md] border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] p-3 pl-4 font-sans shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]" style="border-left:4px solid var(--status-amber)"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">Peg vs market</div><div class="mt-1 font-medium tabular-nums">—</div></div></section><section class="mb-12"><div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3"><div><h2>Scorecard</h2><div class="mt-1 font-sans text-xs text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">7<!-- --> of <!-- -->19<!-- --> criteria answered</div></div><div class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 font-sans text-sm font-medium bg-[color:var(--status-amber-bg)] text-[color:var(--status-amber)]">Amber<!-- --> · <!-- -->100<!-- -->%<span class="ml-1 opacity-70">· pending review</span></div></div><section class="mt-8 rounded-[--radius-md] border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elevated)] p-5 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed"><h3 class="mb-2 font-sans text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">How this score works</h3><p class="mb-3 text-[color:var(--fg)]">Each criterion is worth between 1 and 4 points. The score is the points earned out of the points on criteria that have been answered — shown as a percentage.<!-- --> <strong class="text-[color:var(--status-green)]">Green</strong> is 75% or higher,<!-- --> <strong class="text-[color:var(--status-amber)]">Amber</strong> is 50–74%, and<!-- --> <strong class="text-[color:var(--status-red)]">Red</strong> is below 50%.</p><p class="mb-3 text-[color:var(--fg)]">Some criteria are checked automatically against the proposal data (open source, doxxed team, treasury return clauses, etc.). Others are human-judgment calls — value for money, public good, whether the deliverables are realistic. Those stay blank until a DRep ticks them.</p><p class="mb-3 text-[color:var(--fg)]">Criteria can also be marked <strong>Not applicable</strong>when they don&#x27;t fit the proposal — for example, &quot;open source&quot; doesn&#x27;t apply to a DAO governance proposal with no software output. Those are excluded from the score entirely, neither helping nor hurting.</p><p class="text-[color:var(--fg)]"><strong>Green requires <!-- -->80<!-- -->% coverage.</strong> If less than <!-- -->80<!-- -->% of the applicable criteria (by points) have been answered, the verdict stays at Amber — &quot;pending review&quot; — even when every answered criterion passes. This proposal&#x27;s coverage is currently <span class="tabular-nums font-medium">38<!-- -->%</span> <!-- -->(<!-- -->7<!-- --> of <!-- -->19<!-- --> applicable criteria answered<!-- -->).<!-- --> <!-- -->The auto-calculated band would have been Green, but coverage is below the threshold so the verdict is shown as Amber to flag that judgment criteria are still pending.</p></section></section><section class="mb-12"><div class="mb-4"><h2>Vote intent</h2></div></section><section class="mb-10"><div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between"><h2>Export &amp; audit</h2><a href="/proposals/hydra-2lovelaces-lidonation-cardano-mcp/export.md" class="rounded-[--radius-md] border border-[color:var(--border-strong)] px-3 py-1.5 font-sans text-sm hover:bg-[color:var(--bg-elevated)]">↓ Download scorecard.md</a></div></section><section class="font-sans text-xs text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]"><details><summary class="cursor-pointer">Raw payload · Treasury (<!-- -->true<!-- -->) / Admin (<!-- -->—<!-- -->)</summary><pre class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto rounded-[--radius-md] bg-[color:var(--bg-code)] p-3 text-[11px] text-[color:var(--fg)]">{
