    &quot;has_prior_delivery&quot;: true,
    &quot;prior_delivery_evidence&quot;: &quot;Working prototype already live at github.com/lidonation/Cardano-mcp. Prior delivery: Catalyst Explorer (www.catalystexplorer.com), AdaLink (www.adalink.io). Lido Nation &#x27;plain English, Swahili, and Spanish&#x27; educational content. Emmanuel Titi led the $1M Tooling Sustainability Program at Intersect.&quot;,
